    "tactics": "Orcs charge aggressively using their Aggressive ability to close quickly. Greataxe wielders focus on devastating damage while shield bearers use Shield Block to protect themselves and hold the line. All orcs fight to the death using Relentless when dropped.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Greataxe [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 7 + Melee Combat 3), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 10 damage (6 + 4 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Battleaxe [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 7 + Melee Combat 3), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 10 damage (6 + 4 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Javelin [Combat]: Ranged attack (Dex 4 + Ranged Combat 2), Range: 30/120 ft 1 success = 10 damage (6 + 4 Dex) (short range) 2 successes = 10 damage, DR halved (round up)</p>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Aggressive: Once per turn as a [Free] action, can move up to speed toward a hostile creature it can see. Relentless (1/day): When reduced to 0 HP, make Fortitude save: 1+ successes: Drop to 1 HP instead of 0 HP</p>\n<h4>Feats</h4>\n<p>Starting Feats: Defensive Stance, Shield Master, Power Attack Purchased Feats: None (0 at TR 1/2)</p>",
    "reactionsNotes": "<p>Shield Block: When hit by melee attack, choose one: Attacker must reroll one of their success dice. Gain +2 DR against this attack only.</p>",
